<title>POLAND: BRE TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 109.</title>
<headline>BRE TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 109.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 150,000 shares of Polish bank BRE at 109 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session BRE shares traded at 110 zlotys in a volume of 43,361 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48</p>
</text>
